    "sections": {
        "description": "Beauty Ecommerce X is a minimal fashion, clothing and lifestyle WordPress theme designed for e-commerce shops, bloggers, and online businesses. Built for speed and SEO, Beauty Ecommerce X is responsive, mobile friendly, and works easily with popular builders like Elementor, Brizy, and Divi Builder. Whether you're running a fashion store, corporate site, or a minimalist blog, this theme offers a clean, cool, and modern design with both light and dark mode options. With Gutenberg and block editor compatibility, building landing pages and new templates is easy and intuitive. Beauty Ecommerce X also supports Adsense, affiliate marketing, and banner advertisements, making it ideal for reviewing, writing, blogging and news sites. Woocommerce integration ensures your store is ready to sell, while schema markup enhances your site's visibility in search engines. It's the best option for startups, travel bloggers, or writers looking for a simple, fastest, and free solution with FSE capabilities and customizable color schemes to match your brand. Create an e Commerce shop where you sell cosmetics beauty products like makeup, skincare, haircare and prafumes today!"
    },
